        dcterms:description "Deterministic RNG (`seed=1983`), standalone `--self-test` suite verifying SHA-256 dataset integrity, subcritical stability (sigma < 0 at tau=0.85, 0 condensations), contact-inhibited traction bound, bitwise two-run PDE determinism (`atol=0.0`), exact [0, 1, 2, 4, 5] mode progression, and specimen [1, 2, 4] / [1, 2, 5] hierarchy segmentation (`run_self_test`, L695-748), plus rendered PNG and GIF outputs in `docs/media/`." ;
